          "region": string("Optional part of the screen to look at.",
                           ["full", "top", "bottom", "left", "right", "centre",
                            "top_left", "top_right", "bottom_left", "bottom_right"])}),
    tool("read_screen_text",
         "Read all the text currently visible on screen, with no interpretation. Use "
         "this to read an error message, a document, or anything the user points at.",
         {"region": string("Optional part of the screen to read.",
                           ["full", "top", "bottom", "left", "right", "centre",
                            "top_left", "top_right", "bottom_left", "bottom_right"])}),
    tool("find_on_screen",
         "Locate something on screen by its label and get its exact coordinates. Use "
